ite for release rel00.0, covering:\n\n- **Id:** `test-rel00.0`\n- **Title:** Test Suite for rel00.0 — build lifecycle, cmd/version, pkg/format, pkg/sys, and pkg/testutils\n- **Traces:** References to specific use cases and PRD requirements\n- **Test Cases:** 40+ test cases organized by feature area:\n  - uc001-magefiles: Build lifecycle and version binary (8 tests)\n  - uc002-format: Output formatting (12 tests)\n  - uc003-sys: Syscall abstractions (7 tests)\n  - uc004-testutils: Differential testing harness (13 tests covering DiffTest, RunDiffTests, normalizers, file comparison, timeouts, and environment handling)\n\nThe testutils test cases validate all requirements from the PRD and use case document."}],"totalDurationMs":16861,"totalTokens":24125,"totalToolUseCount":6,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11737,"cache_read_input_tokens":11513,"output_tokens":869,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11737,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
